   "help": [
    "If you are in danger, go back to the help at the top of this page. Tell someone today. These feelings pass, and people recover."
   ],
   "question": [
    "What is one thing God did next for Elijah, or for Moses, that you need right now, and who could you ask to help you with it today?"
   ],
   "again": [
    "Read the passage again before you answer."
   ],
